flowchart TD
    src([source]) -->|to innermost| k1
    subgraph L1[Level one title that is rather long]
        m1[level one node]
        subgraph L2[Level two]
            n1[level two node]
            subgraph L3[Level three with a long title here]
                k1[innermost] --> k2[innermost two]
            end
            n1 --> k1
        end
        m1 --> n1
        k2 --> m2[level one exit]
